---
description: Rules for the collection package
globs: packages/collection/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- Read `packages/collection/AGENTS.md` and `packages/collection/docs/en/ARCHITECTURE.md` first.
- Steps in `when`/`unless`/`alt`/`cond`/`chain` receive the wrapper (ADR 0002); never mutate the value.
- A new method: pure function in `src/<Type>/extensions/<name>.ts`, export it from `extensions/index.ts`, wrap it in
  `<Type>Extensions`, add a unit test (steps in `packages/collection/AGENTS.md`).
- If you change what a method returns or the class ladder, update the diagrams and the return table
  in `docs/{en,ru}/ARCHITECTURE.md`.
